  - m_Id: 2040774160457
    m_Localized: Tactical Manual (Mage)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160456
    m_Localized: Earthquake Magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160455
    m_Localized: Area Expansion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160454
    m_Localized: Tactical Manual (Archer)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160453
    m_Localized: Rain of Arrows
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160452
    m_Localized: Magic Bow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160451
    m_Localized: Tactical Manual (Warrior)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160450
    m_Localized: Healing Factor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160449
    m_Localized: Ancient Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160448
    m_Localized: Spayne
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160447
    m_Localized: Alice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160446
    m_Localized: Noah
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160445
    m_Localized: Serah
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262176796672
    m_Localized: Narration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262227128320
    m_Localized: Fortress Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262227128321
    m_Localized: Demian
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262227128322
    m_Localized: Commander
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262227128323
    m_Localized: System
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322624
    m_Localized: (My first assignment was quieter than I expected.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322625
    m_Localized: Is this the Cies Defense Fortress? They said monsters barely show
      up here, and it really is quiet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322626
    m_Localized: Are you the Commander and the Guardians?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322627
    m_Localized: Welcome to Cies Defense Fortress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322628
    m_Localized: Thanks for the welcome. Sorry to bring up work right away, but could
      you guide us?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322629
    m_Localized: This is Serah, and this is Noah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322630
    m_Localized: Nice to meet you. I am Serah, the front-line guard. I will check
      the gate area first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322631
    m_Localized: I am Noah. I will keep an eye on movement from a distance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322632
    m_Localized: And this is Alice, and this is Spayne.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322633
    m_Localized: I am Alice. I handle signal stone checks and magical support. I
      am more thorough than I look, so do not worry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322634
    m_Localized: I am Spayne. I handle healing. If you are hurt, tell me right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322635
    m_Localized: I am Demian, captain of the Cies Fortress Guard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322636
    m_Localized: We will be counting on you, Demian. We received the tasks to check
      before we arrived.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322637
    m_Localized: Serah, check the gate checkpoint. Noah, watch the forest road from
      the watchtower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322638
    m_Localized: Alice, check the signal stones. Spayne, can you check the supply
      storage?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322639
    m_Localized: Demian, can you assign guides to the four of them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322640
    m_Localized: Understood. I will assign guides at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322641
    m_Localized: All right! I will check the gate checkpoint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322642
    m_Localized: I will check the tower first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322643
    m_Localized: I will check the signal stones, then help Serah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322644
    m_Localized: If it is the supply storage inside the gate... is that not the farthest
      place from here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322645
    m_Localized: Even if it is far, checking it now should keep us from getting lost
      later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322646
    m_Localized: Serah, do you want to switch jobs with me...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322647
    m_Localized: Sorry. I think I should check the checkpoint. Holding the front
      is my job.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322648
    m_Localized: That is so true it just makes me sadder...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322649
    m_Localized: (Just as we were about to check our positions, the alarm bell rang
      loudly inside the fortress.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322650
    m_Localized: Reporting! Monster alarm! We have confirmed multiple monsters from
      the forest! They are approaching the gate!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322651
    m_Localized: Serah... you said it was quiet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322652
    m_Localized: It was quiet!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322653
    m_Localized: First, let us figure out how to make it quiet again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322654
    m_Localized: Noah, keep watching the forest road from the tower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322655
    m_Localized: Spayne, bring first-aid supplies from the storage. Both of you,
      join us at the gate as soon as you are ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322656
    m_Localized: Okay. I will check and come right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322657
    m_Localized: Ugh... I came all the way to the farthest place, and now I have
      to go right back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322658
    m_Localized: Serah and Alice, stop the monsters at the gate checkpoint first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322659
    m_Localized: All right! I will hold here. I will not let them get through to
      the gate!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322660
    m_Localized: Serah, take the front. I will watch the side where enemies gather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322661
    m_Localized: Got it. I will move out as soon as the signal comes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322662
    m_Localized: The monster horde is approaching the gate! Commander, please prepare
      the signal stones!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322663
    m_Localized: I will send the signal to Serah and Alice first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322664
    m_Localized: Signal link confirmed. Serah, are you ready?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322665
    m_Localized: All right, here I go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322666
    m_Localized: '[Tutorial Popup: Learn signal stone timing actions and 3-Sort combo
      attacks]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322667
    m_Localized: Please drag the attack signal stone to Serah's slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322668
    m_Localized: Please line up three matching signal stones to complete a combo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322669
    m_Localized: They are starting to pour out! I will hold the front!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322670
    m_Localized: If enemies group together, I will handle them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322671
    m_Localized: I see the second wave. I will join now. I will watch the enemies
      coming from afar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322672
    m_Localized: The supply storage is locked. I brought bandages too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322673
    m_Localized: Still, I am glad you came right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322674
    m_Localized: If I am late, I will just get busier...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322675
    m_Localized: All right! Now everyone is here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322676
    m_Localized: Now I can at least check on you right away if you get hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322677
    m_Localized: '[Tutorial Popup: Gain EXP by defeating enemies and choose a level-up
      reward]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322678
    m_Localized: Please choose one level-up reward card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322679
    m_Localized: Large monster/boss appears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322680
    m_Localized: I see a big one. This wave is moving around that one!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322681
    m_Localized: Then we just have to stop that big one first. I will take the front!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322682
    m_Localized: Serah, wait! That huge one will take too long with normal attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322683
    m_Localized: Commander, send Serah the skill signal!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322684
    m_Localized: Not a normal signal. It is an ultimate signal that uses the entire
      gauge!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322685
    m_Localized: '[Tutorial Popup: Use the gauge to activate an ultimate skill]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322686
    m_Localized: Please use the Ultimate Gauge to activate Serah's ultimate skill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322687
    m_Localized: Signal confirmed! I will hit it with one big blow!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322688
    m_Localized: (We defeated all the monsters in front of the gate.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322689
    m_Localized: Is anyone hurt? Do not push yourself. Tell me right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322690
    m_Localized: No! I am not hurt! The stone pavement by the gate is... well, probably
      fine?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322691
    m_Localized: Probably fine is not how we should end that, but at least we stopped
      the monsters before they reached the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322692
    m_Localized: I will check the stone pavement. If repairs get worse later, it
      will be more annoying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322693
    m_Localized: But something is strange. That monster horde all came down from
      the forest road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262231322694
    m_Localized: When I looked from the watchtower, there was still movement deeper
      along the forest road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711232
    m_Localized: Then we need to check the forest road again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711233
    m_Localized: Cies is not normally a place where monsters swarm like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711234
    m_Localized: They said it was a quiet post, but that rumor was completely wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711235
    m_Localized: The first person to say that rumor was Serah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711236
    m_Localized: Then I just have to check it myself and correct it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711237
    m_Localized: Wait, I see something in front of the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711238
    m_Localized: Something shining was left where the monsters passed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711239
    m_Localized: You are right. Something is shining!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711240
    m_Localized: I do not want to touch it carelessly and make more work...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711241
    m_Localized: Alice, can you check it for me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711242
    m_Localized: Yes. I checked it, and it does not seem dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711243
    m_Localized: The reaction is similar to a signal stone's, but a little different.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711244
    m_Localized: This is a relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711245
    m_Localized: '[Tutorial Popup: Choose a relic reward]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711246
    m_Localized: Relic effects carry over to the next stage. Please choose one of
      the three.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711247
    m_Localized: Then we should choose carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711248
    m_Localized: Then something related to Serah would be good, so she can hold the
      front longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711249
    m_Localized: The forest road has poor visibility. If Serah holds the front, everyone
      can move more easily.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711250
    m_Localized: Ancient Armor acquired. Its effect will remain in later stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711251
    m_Localized: Selected. This effect will remain in the next battle too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711252
    m_Localized: Let us check the forest road first. Noah, follow the traces left
      by the monsters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711253
    m_Localized: Okay. The traces are still there. I will follow them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711254
    m_Localized: I will check the signal stones again. We need to tune them before
      the next group comes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711255
    m_Localized: All right! Let us find the cause and get our quiet post back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711256
    m_Localized: Then let us move now. We will not have to go too far, right...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711257
    m_Localized: Please tell me we do not have to go far...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863262239711258
    m_Localized: (The commotion at the gate had ended, but it seemed the movement
      in the forest had not stopped yet.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299390316544
    m_Localized: Let's start checking from here. We won't go too far from the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065280
    m_Localized: Yeah. There are footprints here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065281
    m_Localized: If we look a little more, I think we can tell which way they go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065282
    m_Localized: Got it. Then let's check carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065283
    m_Localized: All right. Let's start with the traces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065284
    m_Localized: We can figure out where they came down toward the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065285
    m_Localized: I'll mark the way back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065286
    m_Localized: If we get lost here, our break time disappears too...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065287
    m_Localized: That would definitely be a big problem!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065288
    m_Localized: Getting lost on the way back is the bigger problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065289
    m_Localized: Both are important...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065290
    m_Localized: Maybe because this is a forest road, the air feels damp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065291
    m_Localized: The dirt path is soft, and the sunlight is blocked...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065292
    m_Localized: If your next words are about being sleepy, please hold them in for
      a bit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065293
    m_Localized: I hadn't said that yet...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065294
    m_Localized: Right. And you just said\"yet.\"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065295
    m_Localized: Wait. The grass by the road is pressed down in one direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065296
    m_Localized: Which way does it lead?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065297
    m_Localized: The monster traces lead from deeper in the forest toward the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065298
    m_Localized: There seem to have been quite a few of them. The footprints overlap
      all over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065299
    m_Localized: Ngh...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065300
    m_Localized: Noah?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065301
    m_Localized: Sorry. I was just a little startled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065302
    m_Localized: That sound came from the direction the footprints lead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065303
    m_Localized: Got it. If something comes from there, I'll stop it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065304
    m_Localized: Serah, don't go too far ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065305
    m_Localized: Move where Noah can still keep track.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065306
    m_Localized: Got it. I won't go too far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065307
    m_Localized: Yeah... as I thought, these traces don't look like they were aiming
      for the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065308
    m_Localized: There are a lot of skid marks. Almost no signs that they stopped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065309
    m_Localized: It looks like the monsters came fleeing down from deeper in the
      forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065310
    m_Localized: Then does that mean something deeper in the forest is chasing them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065311
    m_Localized: I don't know yet. But they didn't choose this direction on their
      own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065312
    m_Localized: So they weren't aiming for the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065313
    m_Localized: It looks more like they were running away from something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065314
    m_Localized: Commander, I hear monster footsteps getting closer from deeper in
      the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065315
    m_Localized: It's the same direction as the traces we saw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065316
    m_Localized: If we fall back now, they may come all the way to the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065317
    m_Localized: Then we'll stop them here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065318
    m_Localized: Confirmed! I'll take the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065319
    m_Localized: All right. I'll clear out the side where they gather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065320
    m_Localized: Ugh... fighting on a road like this isn't exactly ideal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065321
    m_Localized: Still, it's better than letting them push all the way to the gate...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065322
    m_Localized: Is everyone okay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065323
    m_Localized: If anything hurts, tell me right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065324
    m_Localized: If you stay quiet and endure it, it will hurt more...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065325
    m_Localized: And that means more work for me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065326
    m_Localized: I'm fine! I'm not hurt!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065327
    m_Localized: Noah, if you see more movement, tell me right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065328
    m_Localized: I'll stop them at the front again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065329
    m_Localized: Okay. I won't miss it either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065330
    m_Localized: I'm fine too. Spayne?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065331
    m_Localized: Yeah, me too. The forest road was just a little uncomfortable...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065332
    m_Localized: That's a relief. Let's talk after we get back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065333
    m_Localized: Getting out safely comes first right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065334
    m_Localized: I'm glad everyone is okay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065335
    m_Localized: Let's not go any deeper for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299428065336
    m_Localized: First, let's head back toward the gate and sort things out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453888
    m_Localized: Yeah. That sounds good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453889
    m_Localized: Got it. Spayne, can you still see the marks for the way back?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453890
    m_Localized: Yeah. I can see the cloth I marked, and our footprints are still
      there too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453891
    m_Localized: Wait. Monster footprints that turn off from the forest path in front
      of the gate are mixed in here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453892
    m_Localized: Ugh... I was only trying to check the way back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453893
    m_Localized: Still, thanks to that, we found traces that leave the forest path
      in front of the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453894
    m_Localized: Where do they lead?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453895
    m_Localized: Toward the entrance road leading south of the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453896
    m_Localized: They look similar to the traces we saw on the forest road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453897
    m_Localized: So monsters passed through that way too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453898
    m_Localized: The southern entrance road...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453899
    m_Localized: All right. Let's return to the gate first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453900
    m_Localized: Once we're done reorganizing, we'll check that way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453901
    m_Localized: Is this the southern entrance road?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453902
    m_Localized: The location is right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453903
    m_Localized: The road is narrow. It does not look like a route for a large force.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453904
    m_Localized: But the footprints continue this far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453905
    m_Localized: These are the monster footprints that branched off from the forest
      path in front of the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453906
    m_Localized: The depth and direction of the footprints are similar to what we
      saw on the forest path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453907
    m_Localized: If the road is narrow, it should be easier for me to stop them up
      front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453908
    m_Localized: That is not the only thing to consider.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453909
    m_Localized: If our view opens up late, our reaction will be late too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453910
    m_Localized: Just looking at the ground makes it look hard to walk on...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453911
    m_Localized: It will not be easy to move injured people here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453912
    m_Localized: Then I just have to stop them before anyone gets hurt!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453913
    m_Localized: That is true, but do not move too far ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453914
    m_Localized: Got it. I will take only the area I can see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453915
    m_Localized: This road should lead toward the gate wall too, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453916
    m_Localized: Yes. If it follows this direction, it should lead toward the front
      of the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453917
    m_Localized: Let us not go too deep into this road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453918
    m_Localized: We will check the entrance. If it is dangerous, we will stop them
      here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453919
    m_Localized: The monster footprints are clearer now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453920
    m_Localized: They are pressed deeper than the ones we saw on the forest path
      in front of the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453921
    m_Localized: It looks like they could not slow down here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453922
    m_Localized: If they came rushing down like that, we have no choice but to stop
      them from the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453923
    m_Localized: Yes. There are a lot of overlapping footprints.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453924
    m_Localized: They are not lined up in one direction. Some are twisted off to
      the side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453925
    m_Localized: These do not look like traces of monsters marching down to attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453926
    m_Localized: So this is not just happening on the forest path in front of the
      gate. It reaches this road too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453927
    m_Localized: If we get pushed back on a road like this, falling down and stopping
      them both sound like trouble...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453928
    m_Localized: Then we just stop them before they fall, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453929
    m_Localized: It is scarier when you say it like it is that easy...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453930
    m_Localized: Wait. There is movement inside the bushes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453931
    m_Localized: There is movement where the footprints continue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453932
    m_Localized: Which direction are they coming from?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453933
    m_Localized: From deeper inside the southern entrance road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299436453934
    m_Localized: It is the same direction as the footprints we saw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648192
    m_Localized: Looks like this is going to get bigger...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648193
    m_Localized: If we get pushed back, it leads straight to the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648194
    m_Localized: Then we will stop them here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648195
    m_Localized: Commander, I think they are about to come out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648196
    m_Localized: The road is narrow, so I do not think many can come down at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648197
    m_Localized: If Serah stops them up front, I can land my magic too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648198
    m_Localized: Good. We will stop them here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648199
    m_Localized: Understood. I will stop them from the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648200
    m_Localized: I will trust you with the rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648201
    m_Localized: Okay. Just hold where I can see you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648202
    m_Localized: Of course. I will not go too deep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648203
    m_Localized: Please choose the way where everyone gets hurt less...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648204
    m_Localized: If someone falls here, getting them up looks hard too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648205
    m_Localized: I will keep watching their movement from here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648206
    m_Localized: Serah, if you go too deep, I will tell you right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648207
    m_Localized: Got it. If Noah says it, I will adjust right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648208
    m_Localized: Is everyone okay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648209
    m_Localized: Is anyone hurt?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648210
    m_Localized: I am okay! I am not hurt!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648211
    m_Localized: The narrow road was not as bad as I thought.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648212
    m_Localized: I am okay too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648213
    m_Localized: You know that was pretty close, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648214
    m_Localized: It was close, but I still stopped them, did I not?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648215
    m_Localized: True... but next time, be a little more careful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648216
    m_Localized: Yeah, me too... The road was just uncomfortable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648217
    m_Localized: I do not want to stay in a place like this for long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648218
    m_Localized: I will check the monster footprints again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648219
    m_Localized: Yes. Check whether they connect toward the gate wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648220
    m_Localized: They do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648221
    m_Localized: The traces from the forest path in front of the gate and the southern
      entrance road turn in the same direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648222
    m_Localized: Then both roads meet in front of the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648223
    m_Localized: And there is still movement deeper inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648224
    m_Localized: It may continue toward the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648225
    m_Localized: Then next time, I will check the direction Noah is watching first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648226
    m_Localized: Yeah. I will make sure I do not miss it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648227
    m_Localized: It is good that we are getting more in sync...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648228
    m_Localized: So why does it feel like we have more work every time...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648229
    m_Localized: We have checked the monster traces on the southern entrance road
      enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1035299440648230
    m_Localized: Next, let us check the area in front of the gate wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901911920640
    m_Localized: Commander, Guardians.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669376
    m_Localized: I will organize the defense records from the gate front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669377
    m_Localized: Thanks, Demian.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669378
    m_Localized: Before we head to the forest path, let us check our condition first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669379
    m_Localized: Yeah. It does not look like anyone is badly hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669380
    m_Localized: No one being badly hurt is a good thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669381
    m_Localized: It also means I have less work to do...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669382
    m_Localized: That started like a nice comment and ended up being about you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669383
    m_Localized: Still, everyone is safe, so that is what matters!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669384
    m_Localized: We can stop the next one with this momentum too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669385
    m_Localized: Before we rely on momentum, let us check the signal stones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669386
    m_Localized: I looked at the first battle records.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669387
    m_Localized: The signal the Commander sent is still holding steady.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669388
    m_Localized: Can we carry that into the next battle?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669389
    m_Localized: We can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669390
    m_Localized: If we tune it now, one person's combat style will become more stable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669391
    m_Localized: If we can prepare before heading to the forest path, that would
      help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669392
    m_Localized: Then strengthening whoever can hold the front longer sounds good!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669393
    m_Localized: If it means fewer people get hurt, I am in favor too...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669394
    m_Localized: Commander, choose the tuning direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669395
    m_Localized: '[Event Enhancement: Choose one from Serah HP increase / Noah attack
      increase / Spayne healing increase]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669396
    m_Localized: '[Display that the selected enhancement will remain active in later
      battles]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669397
    m_Localized: Tuned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669398
    m_Localized: This enhancement will remain active from the next battle onward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669399
    m_Localized: Good! Then I can stand in front with more confidence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669400
    m_Localized: I will keep a closer watch on the forest path movement too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669401
    m_Localized: Then let us check it quickly and come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669402
    m_Localized: If we take too long, our rest time disappears too...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669403
    m_Localized: There is still movement near the forest path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669404
    m_Localized: Please be careful if you go far from the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669405
    m_Localized: Got it. We will not go too far from the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669406
    m_Localized: Everyone ready?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669407
    m_Localized: Yeah! If the road gets narrow, I will take the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901949669408
    m_Localized: I will look for traces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057984
    m_Localized: We need to confirm whether the monsters targeted the gate or fled
      down here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057985
    m_Localized: I will mark the way back too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057986
    m_Localized: If we get lost, we will have to camp out... and I do not want that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057987
    m_Localized: Guardians, are you unharmed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057988
    m_Localized: Yeah. We checked the southern entrance too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057989
    m_Localized: The forest path in front of the gate, and the southern entrance
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057990
    m_Localized: The footprints all end up leading this way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057991
    m_Localized: So they ended up converging here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057992
    m_Localized: Yes. We can see the same traces in front of the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057993
    m_Localized: The footprints from both roads overlap around here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057994
    m_Localized: Did the first group we stopped at the gate come from the same direction?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057995
    m_Localized: Yeah. I think that is the right way to read it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057996
    m_Localized: There are more sliding marks than signs that they tried to stop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057997
    m_Localized: So they were not aiming for the gate. They kept getting driven down
      here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057998
    m_Localized: Then if we get pushed back here, the gate is right behind us...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958057999
    m_Localized: We will be lucky if repairs are all we need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058000
    m_Localized: Then we just have to hold our ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058001
    m_Localized: I will handle the front of the gate!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058002
    m_Localized: The way you make that sound easy makes it scarier...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058003
    m_Localized: Still, she is not wrong. This time, the gate is right behind us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058004
    m_Localized: If you move too far forward, we cannot support you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058005
    m_Localized: Got it. I will hold them where you can see me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058006
    m_Localized: The movement deeper in the forest is getting closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058007
    m_Localized: They are coming down from both the forest path in front of the gate
      and the southern entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058008
    m_Localized: I will pull the soldiers back behind the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058009
    m_Localized: While you hold them off, we will check the wall's condition.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058010
    m_Localized: Good. We will defend the gate here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058011
    m_Localized: Defending is fine... but if you get hurt, tell me right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058012
    m_Localized: The more you hide it here, the bigger the problem will get.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058013
    m_Localized: Do not worry! I will not let anything get past this point!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058014
    m_Localized: Good. Just keep that distance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058015
    m_Localized: Got it. I will take the front!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058016
    m_Localized: Is everyone okay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058017
    m_Localized: No one is hurt?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058018
    m_Localized: I am fine!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058019
    m_Localized: I held the front of the gate!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058020
    m_Localized: Yeah. You held it properly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058021
    m_Localized: Still, we need to check the wall's condition.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058022
    m_Localized: Looking fine and actually being fine are different...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058023
    m_Localized: Demian, how is the wall?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058024
    m_Localized: The wall is still holding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058025
    m_Localized: But it has taken quite a lot of impact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058026
    m_Localized: It would be risky to have it hold one more time in this state.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058027
    m_Localized: Would it be hard to defend again right away?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058028
    m_Localized: Yes. We need at least a short time to reinforce it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058029
    m_Localized: If we repair the wall, it can hold through the next battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058030
    m_Localized: There is still movement deeper in the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058031
    m_Localized: There are heavier footsteps mixed in than before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058032
    m_Localized: Then fighting again right away would be dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058033
    m_Localized: Let us repair the wall first, then check the movement inside again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058034
    m_Localized: If we have maintenance time, maybe I can close my eyes for a moment...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058035
    m_Localized: Sleeping is not included in maintenance time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058036
    m_Localized: I did not even finish saying it yet...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058037
    m_Localized: ...No, you were mostly right, though.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058038
    m_Localized: Good. Let us start with the gate wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058039
    m_Localized: Noah and Alice, keep checking the movement deeper in the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058040
    m_Localized: Serah and Spayne, check the repair points with the soldiers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058041
    m_Localized: Yeah. I will keep watching the movement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058042
    m_Localized: Good. I will get ready before the next battle!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058043
    m_Localized: Getting ready is good... but this time, please aim for fewer injuries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058044
    m_Localized: Whether it is you or the wall, more things to fix means more work...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058045
    m_Localized: Demian, this crack looks pretty bad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058046
    m_Localized: If we leave this side alone, it will open up wider next time...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058047
    m_Localized: We will reinforce the gate wall at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058048
    m_Localized: We cannot fully repair it, but we can make it strong enough for
      the next battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058049
    m_Localized: Then it is better to do that now...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058050
    m_Localized: If it collapses later, there will be too many places to fix.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058051
    m_Localized: Then let us make it as sturdy as we can right now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058052
    m_Localized: If the wall holds, I can hold the line longer too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058053
    m_Localized: If both hold, that gives me fewer things to check...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058054
    m_Localized: Exactly. That is why we are repairing it now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058055
    m_Localized: '[Gate wall reinforcement complete. Wall HP has been restored.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058056
    m_Localized: The gate wall reinforcement is done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058057
    m_Localized: We can tune the signal stones one more time too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058058
    m_Localized: It would be best to choose one more enhancement before the final
      battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058059
    m_Localized: The enhancement you choose now will carry over into the next battle
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058060
    m_Localized: Good. Tune it where we need it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901958058061
    m_Localized: I will be the one holding the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252288
    m_Localized: I will keep watching movement farther back too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252289
    m_Localized: I am fine with anything that means fewer things to fix, whether
      it is people or the wall...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252290
    m_Localized: Good. Let us do the final tuning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252291
    m_Localized: '[Display character permanent enhancement candidates]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252292
    m_Localized: '[The player selects one enhancement]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252293
    m_Localized: '[Display that the selected enhancement will remain active in later
      battles]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252294
    m_Localized: Tuned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252295
    m_Localized: Now let us check the next battle's intel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252296
    m_Localized: Commander, the movement deeper in the forest is strange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252297
    m_Localized: One set of footsteps is unusually heavy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252298
    m_Localized: The nearby monsters seem to be getting swept along by that sound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252299
    m_Localized: We still do not know whether it is leading the horde or being driven
      along with them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252300
    m_Localized: But that one will be the most dangerous in the next battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252301
    m_Localized: '[Boss intel confirmed: Final horde centered around a large monster]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252302
    m_Localized: Let us stop them at the village road entrance behind the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252303
    m_Localized: We need to stop that thing while the wall holds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252304
    m_Localized: Got it. I will stop that one from the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252305
    m_Localized: I will not let it get behind the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252306
    m_Localized: Please try not to get too badly hurt...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252307
    m_Localized: I would like the wall to be the only thing we need to fix.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252308
    m_Localized: Now let us move to the defense line behind the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252309
    m_Localized: So we have to hurry all the way to the end...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252310
    m_Localized: It is better than arriving late and making things harder!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252311
    m_Localized: Serah took my logic...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252312
    m_Localized: Commander, that is the heavy footstep I heard earlier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252313
    m_Localized: It is almost here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252314
    m_Localized: The nearby monsters are being dragged down with it too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252315
    m_Localized: There is no time to check anything else here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252316
    m_Localized: Then we cannot let this drag on...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252317
    m_Localized: I will watch the healing timing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252318
    m_Localized: Like I said before, I will hold the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252319
    m_Localized: I will not let them get behind the gate!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252320
    m_Localized: Yeah. That is reassuring.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252321
    m_Localized: Just hold your ground where we can see you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252322
    m_Localized: Got it. I will show you what I can do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252323
    m_Localized: I will keep watching the enemies coming in from far away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252324
    m_Localized: If you get hurt, tell me right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252325
    m_Localized: So please do not push yourself too hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252326
    m_Localized: Good. Let us stop them at the central defense line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252327
    m_Localized: '[Boss Battle Start]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252328
    m_Localized: The movement is slowing down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252329
    m_Localized: At least the horde that was rushing in seems to have stopped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252330
    m_Localized: Good! We defended Cies Defense Fortress!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252331
    m_Localized: Yeah. I am glad everyone is safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252332
    m_Localized: We protected both the gate and the village road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252333
    m_Localized: We stopped the horde that came today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252334
    m_Localized: The cause is still unresolved, but this is definitely an accomplishment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252335
    m_Localized: Then since we accomplished something, that means there is rest time
      too, right...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252336
    m_Localized: Guardians, thank you very much for your hard work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252337
    m_Localized: Thanks to you, Cies Defense Fortress is safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252338
    m_Localized: Everyone, good work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901962252339
    m_Localized: Commander, we received a message from the Jeple direction during
      the battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446592
    m_Localized: They say monsters are also moving in one direction over there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446593
    m_Localized: So this was not only happening here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446594
    m_Localized: Similar movement may continue elsewhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446595
    m_Localized: At least one thing is clear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446596
    m_Localized: This is not a problem limited to Cies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446597
    m_Localized: We protected Cies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446598
    m_Localized: That much we definitely did.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446599
    m_Localized: Let us check the report from Jeple too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446600
    m_Localized: Then there is still work left...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446601
    m_Localized: We need to sort out the situation first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446602
    m_Localized: Then sorting things out right now is very important...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446603
    m_Localized: Got it. Let us organize the Cies situation first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446604
    m_Localized: We will check the Jeple report after that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446605
    m_Localized: Cies Defense Fortress Gate Front
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446606
    m_Localized: First Joint Maintenance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446607
    m_Localized: Forest Path in Front of Cies Gate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446608
    m_Localized: Cies Defense Fortress Southern Entrance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446609
    m_Localized: Cies Defense Fortress Gate Wall Front
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901966446610
    m_Localized: Gate Wall Maintenance Before the Boss Battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640896
    m_Localized: Cies Defense Fortress Central Defense Line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160528
    m_Localized: Wave 1 ready. Place signal stones to strengthen heroes before battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640897
    m_Localized: Drag the attack signal stone to Serah's slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640898
    m_Localized: COMBO +1. Serah attack boost X1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640899
    m_Localized: Remaining sort count decreased from 6 to 5.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640900
    m_Localized: Setup complete. Press BATTLE START to begin combat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640901
    m_Localized: Level Up! Select the reward you want.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640902
    m_Localized: Tap a reward card once to select it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640903
    m_Localized: Tap the selected card once more to confirm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640904
    m_Localized: '[Sharp Senses] Attack +8 acquired!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640905
    m_Localized: Noah joins. Ranged support ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640906
    m_Localized: Spayne joins. All heroes ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640907
    m_Localized: Noah and Spayne join!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640908
    m_Localized: A large monster appeared. Prepare Serah's skill signal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640909
    m_Localized: Serah's ultimate gauge is full.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640910
    m_Localized: Touch Serah's portrait to use her ultimate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640911
    m_Localized: Ultimate activated!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640912
    m_Localized: Touch the screen during the cutscene to show the Skip button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640913
    m_Localized: Stage Clear! Check your rewards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640914
    m_Localized: Relic effects carry over to the next stage. Choose 1 of 3.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640915
    m_Localized: Tap the selected relic once more to confirm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2554901970640916
    m_Localized: Ancient Armor acquired. The selected relic has been registered in
      your owned list. Its effect remains in later stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160384
    m_Localized: Swiftness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160385
    m_Localized: Keen Vision
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160386
    m_Localized: Keen Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160387
    m_Localized: Overflowing Vitality
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160388
    m_Localized: Flowing Vitality
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160389
    m_Localized: Body Enhancement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160390
    m_Localized: Lightweight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160391
    m_Localized: Condensed Power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160392
    m_Localized: Overload
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160393
    m_Localized: Breath of Wind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160394
    m_Localized: Beastform
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160395
    m_Localized: Ironwall Momentum
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160396
    m_Localized: Monster Name
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160464
    m_Localized: Monster Skill Info
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2040774160517
    m_Localized: Active Skill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233806413824
    m_Localized: Then that means they went farther into where the people are.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356864
    m_Localized: Yeah. The traces that split off in front of the gate headed toward
      the farm district.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356865
    m_Localized: Judging by the report, they have already gone deep into the farms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356866
    m_Localized: If it is a field path, there will probably be mud...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356867
    m_Localized: If I fall, washing up will take longer than resting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356868
    m_Localized: This is not the time to calculate break time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356869
    m_Localized: Do not underestimate rest...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356870
    m_Localized: First, let us move to the temporary command post.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356871
    m_Localized: Before we head to the farms, let us sort out the records from the
      gate front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356872
    m_Localized: Yeah. I will check the signal stone responses too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356873
    m_Localized: Let us check which road they split off onto.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356874
    m_Localized: All right. Once we are done sorting this out, let us head straight
      to the farms!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356875
    m_Localized: I will keep watching the traces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356876
    m_Localized: Then let us hurry and finish sorting this out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356877
    m_Localized: The longer this takes, the farther break time gets...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356878
    m_Localized: Most of the residents inside the gate have evacuated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356879
    m_Localized: There are few injured, but the supply carts were shaken up badly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356880
    m_Localized: It is a relief that there are not many injured.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356881
    m_Localized: If they ask me to treat the carts too, I will be in trouble...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356882
    m_Localized: We kept the damage small.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356883
    m_Localized: Now the question is which road this group leads to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356884
    m_Localized: The footprints continue outside the gate too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356885
    m_Localized: There are almost no signs that they stopped or circled around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356886
    m_Localized: Then, like at Cies, we stopped the incoming group here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356887
    m_Localized: Yeah. But Jeple has more roads.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356888
    m_Localized: Even if we block them at the gate, they can split off onto other
      roads.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356889
    m_Localized: Keep the gate defense records organized.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233848356890
    m_Localized: Let us compare them with the Cies records.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745472
    m_Localized: If we compare them, we should be able to find the point where they
      split off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745473
    m_Localized: Commander, we have an additional report from the farm district.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745474
    m_Localized: Fences have been pushed in at several places, and monsters are passing
      between the fields.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745475
    m_Localized: Between the fields? What about the people?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745476
    m_Localized: The managers are evacuating them, but the farm roads are wide, so
      they are difficult to block.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745477
    m_Localized: The traces split off right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745478
    m_Localized: Let us check the farm district first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745479
    m_Localized: On field paths, your feet can sink in...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745480
    m_Localized: I guess today's shoes are done for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745481
    m_Localized: Let us organize the defense records and move right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745482
    m_Localized: The permanent enhancement selection UI opens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745483
    m_Localized: 'Selection examples: Serah attack increase / Spayne defense increase
      / Alice HP increase.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745484
    m_Localized: The selected enhancement remains in later battles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745485
    m_Localized: Are you the Guardians? This way, please!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745486
    m_Localized: The monsters broke the fence and passed between the fields.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745487
    m_Localized: Did everyone evacuate?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745488
    m_Localized: The nearby people have been evacuated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745489
    m_Localized: But evacuation is not finished yet along the road by the work shed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745490
    m_Localized: There are almost no signs that they ate the crops.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745491
    m_Localized: It is closer to them simply pushing through as they passed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745492
    m_Localized: The wide farm roads are the problem instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745493
    m_Localized: The more places there are to block, the more paths there are for
      them to slip through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745494
    m_Localized: Field paths make your feet sink in more easily than they look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745495
    m_Localized: If you fall, your clothes might end up worse off than your injuries...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745496
    m_Localized: All right. Then let us stop them in front of the work shed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745497
    m_Localized: I will not let them get toward the work shed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745498
    m_Localized: Manager, please evacuate the people to the opposite side of the
      work shed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745499
    m_Localized: We will stop the group coming in between the fields.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745500
    m_Localized: Understood. I will guide them to the road on the opposite side of
      the work shed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745501
    m_Localized: The footprints split into two paths.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745502
    m_Localized: The large group's tracks lead through the middle of the fields,
      and the small group's tracks lead along the fence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745503
    m_Localized: If we do not stop the ones moving along the fence first, they will
      overlap with the residents' evacuation route.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745504
    m_Localized: Serah, take the inside of the front fence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745505
    m_Localized: Leave it to me! I will not let them past the fence!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745506
    m_Localized: Do not go too far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745507
    m_Localized: Pulling someone out of mud is harder than treating them...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745508
    m_Localized: The movement is getting closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745509
    m_Localized: They are coming straight into the middle of the fields.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745510
    m_Localized: All right. Let us stop them on the path between the fields.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745511
    m_Localized: Let us finish this before they cross the evacuation route.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745512
    m_Localized: We prevented damage near the work shed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745513
    m_Localized: The people were not badly hurt either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745514
    m_Localized: That is a relief.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745515
    m_Localized: If the fence was pushed in that much, anyone nearby would have been
      in danger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745516
    m_Localized: Yeah. There are few signs that the monsters stopped to fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745517
    m_Localized: They kept being driven forward like they were lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745518
    m_Localized: The farm terrain split the footprints.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745519
    m_Localized: We stopped one side, but the other trail continues toward the market
      street.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745520
    m_Localized: If it is the market, there will be more people... right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745521
    m_Localized: It should be easier to walk than the fields, but there will be more
      people and baggage too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745522
    m_Localized: There are merchants on the market side who still have not evacuated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745523
    m_Localized: Many people will have trouble moving right away if they leave their
      goods behind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745524
    m_Localized: Then we have to hurry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745525
    m_Localized: If they get into a crowded place, it will become more dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745526
    m_Localized: The footprints lead to the market main road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745527
    m_Localized: Some followed the road used by carts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745528
    m_Localized: The monsters did not choose people. They were driven onto the roads
      people use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745529
    m_Localized: That makes stopping them more difficult too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745530
    m_Localized: Let us leave the farm district to the managers and move to the market
      street.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745531
    m_Localized: If it is the market, even finding injured people will be work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745532
    m_Localized: Do not think of finding people as just work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745533
    m_Localized: Ugh... If finding them takes too long, treatment will be delayed
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745534
    m_Localized: This way! A cart is blocking the road!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745535
    m_Localized: The residents are moving into the inner alleys.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745536
    m_Localized: But the market main road has not been cleared yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745537
    m_Localized: People come first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233856745538
    m_Localized: Let us move the carts ourselves, even if we have to push them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939776
    m_Localized: If we rush to push heavy carts, our backs will give out first...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939777
    m_Localized: Still, that is better than being pushed by monsters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939778
    m_Localized: The footprints from the farm side lead here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939779
    m_Localized: It does not look like they avoided the stalls. It looks like they
      came in along the gaps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939780
    m_Localized: The market main road is where merchants do business, and also the
      evacuation route residents use to get out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939781
    m_Localized: If monsters get into the market main road, there will be damage
      even if they are not aiming for anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939782
    m_Localized: Let us form a defensive line while keeping the evacuation route
      open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939783
    m_Localized: Keep the main road open, and stop the incoming group at the market
      entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939784
    m_Localized: Got it. I will leave a path for people to pass!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939785
    m_Localized: If Serah takes the front, I will watch the ones slipping between
      the stalls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939786
    m_Localized: I will check the movement on the rooftops too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939787
    m_Localized: There are many places in the market where visibility is blocked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939788
    m_Localized: Send injured people inside the defensive line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939789
    m_Localized: If they hold out beside the stalls, it will be hard for me to find
      them...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939790
    m_Localized: The road is clear!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939791
    m_Localized: But there is noise coming from the farm-side entrance!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939792
    m_Localized: They are coming in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939793
    m_Localized: We need to stop them before they scatter between the stalls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939794
    m_Localized: All right. Let us stop them at the market entrance before they scatter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939795
    m_Localized: The residents inside the market have evacuated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939796
    m_Localized: We prevented major damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939797
    m_Localized: Good. We protected the people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939798
    m_Localized: The problem is that they made it this far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939799
    m_Localized: There are no signs that the monsters chased people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939800
    m_Localized: Instead, they stepped right through the openings left as people
      evacuated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939801
    m_Localized: That is why it was more dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939802
    m_Localized: Jeple has many roads, so people have many places to escape, but
      the same applies to monsters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939803
    m_Localized: If people are scattered, treating them becomes difficult too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939804
    m_Localized: Because it takes time just to find out who is hurt...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939805
    m_Localized: I heard there was a commotion at the warehouses near the waterway
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939806
    m_Localized: They say the waterway is blocked, narrowing the road between the
      warehouses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939807
    m_Localized: The footprints lead toward the waterway too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939808
    m_Localized: They followed the market main road, then turned toward the waterway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233860939809
    m_Localized: If the waterway is blocked, their movement path could bend even
      more strangely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134080
    m_Localized: It will affect not only monsters, but people's evacuation too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134081
    m_Localized: Then we should block the waterway side too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134082
    m_Localized: We protected the market, so we just have to protect the next road
      too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134083
    m_Localized: If it is by the water, it will be slippery...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134084
    m_Localized: This time, I will warn everyone to be careful before they fall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134085
    m_Localized: Let us move to the waterway and warehouse area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134086
    m_Localized: Let us check whether the waterways are affecting monster movement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134087
    m_Localized: Did you come from the market side?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134088
    m_Localized: The waterway is blocked, so the road between the warehouses has
      narrowed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134089
    m_Localized: The monsters are swarming into the road between the warehouses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134090
    m_Localized: The footprints turned at the water's edge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134091
    m_Localized: I still do not know whether they were avoiding the water or were
      pushed into a detour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134092
    m_Localized: We can see that the path is tangled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134093
    m_Localized: The blocked waterway has narrowed even the paths people use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134094
    m_Localized: If the roads shrink, does that not make them easier to block?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134095
    m_Localized: Temporarily, maybe. But if everything is forced into one place,
      the force gathers there too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134096
    m_Localized: If you get pushed near the water, there are all kinds of ways to
      get hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134097
    m_Localized: Slipping, bumping into things, getting soaked... It is not a very
      good combination.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134098
    m_Localized: Are there any people left along the waterway edge?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233865134099
    m_Localized: The warehouse staff have been evacuated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328384
    m_Localized: However, warehouse supplies are blocking the road, so the clearing
      work is being delayed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328385
    m_Localized: The tracks of the large group continue along the road between the
      warehouses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328386
    m_Localized: They are pressed in deeper than what we saw at the market.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328387
    m_Localized: Does that mean there is something bigger?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328388
    m_Localized: It is possible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328389
    m_Localized: But what is close right now is the group up ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328390
    m_Localized: To check the larger movement, we need to open the road beside the
      waterway first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328391
    m_Localized: If we do not clear the waterway, the next defensive line will become
      unstable too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328392
    m_Localized: All right. Then let us stop them on the road beside the waterway
      first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328393
    m_Localized: Be careful near the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328394
    m_Localized: Anyone near the water might get a scolding before I even treat them...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328395
    m_Localized: The movement is getting closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328396
    m_Localized: They are entering the narrow road between the warehouses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328397
    m_Localized: Let us stop them on the road beside the waterway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328398
    m_Localized: Until the waterway clearing is finished, let us stop them before
      they reach the warehouse side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328399
    m_Localized: The damage on the warehouse side did not spread any farther.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328400
    m_Localized: But the waterway needs to be handled immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328401
    m_Localized: The large group's tracks do not end here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328402
    m_Localized: They continue toward the plaza in front of the Lord's Manor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328403
    m_Localized: If they reach the plaza, will there not be more people gathered
      there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328404
    m_Localized: The evacuation site is near the plaza in front of the Lord's Manor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328405
    m_Localized: Right now, the guards are blocking the outside of the plaza.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328406
    m_Localized: It looks like the blocked waterway has tangled the roads.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328407
    m_Localized: The monsters did not follow the waterway, but the blocked waterway
      forced them onto the roads people use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328408
    m_Localized: So we have to stop the water, stop the monsters, and protect the
      people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328409
    m_Localized: There is too much to take care of today...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328410
    m_Localized: The large movement is still on the plaza side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328411
    m_Localized: Its weight is different from the group that came down first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328412
    m_Localized: Before we go to the plaza, let us repair the waterway and defensive
      line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328413
    m_Localized: We need to reduce the incoming movement here, even a little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328414
    m_Localized: Yeah. Let us hurry with the repairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328415
    m_Localized: If we leave it as is, the plaza defensive line will shake sooner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328416
    m_Localized: Got it. I will watch the front while the repairs are happening!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328417
    m_Localized: Then I will check on the repair crew first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328418
    m_Localized: After work by the water, someone always seems to have slipped...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328419
    m_Localized: The blocked waterway has opened a little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328420
    m_Localized: But we need more time to clear all the piles of dirt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328421
    m_Localized: We do not have time to clear everything right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328422
    m_Localized: We need to buy time for the plaza entrance defensive line to hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328423
    m_Localized: All right. Then let us open the waterway even a little more ourselves!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328424
    m_Localized: A hastily built defensive line always seems to cause trouble again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328425
    m_Localized: Still, keeping it from collapsing comes first right now...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328426
    m_Localized: The large group's tracks continue toward the plaza.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328427
    m_Localized: The nearby monsters are being swept in that direction too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328428
    m_Localized: We still do not know whether the large creature is leading the group
      or being driven along just the same.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328429
    m_Localized: But one thing is certain. If they get past the plaza entrance, the
      damage will grow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328430
    m_Localized: Prepare the defense of the plaza in front of the Lord's Manor, and
      move as soon as the temporary repairs are finished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328431
    m_Localized: I will reinforce the temporary defensive line by the waterway and
      inform the guards near the plaza as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328432
    m_Localized: Guide the injured people to the evacuation route behind the Lord's
      Manor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328433
    m_Localized: If the evacuation route is blocked, treatment will be delayed too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328434
    m_Localized: Got it. I will keep the evacuation route open!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328435
    m_Localized: The monster movement near the waterway has slowed a little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328436
    m_Localized: Opening the waterway seems to be working.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328437
    m_Localized: Then we should use this chance to make repairs. But we cannot get
      stuck here for long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328438
    m_Localized: Wall HP is restored.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328439
    m_Localized: The permanent enhancement selection UI opens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328440
    m_Localized: 'Selection examples: Noah critical rate increase / Serah HP increase
      / Spayne healing amount increase.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328441
    m_Localized: The selected enhancement remains in later battles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328442
    m_Localized: The large movement is getting closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328443
    m_Localized: The first to arrive will be the group up front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328444
    m_Localized: All right. Move to the plaza entrance and stop them before they
      reach the center of Jeple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328445
    m_Localized: The residents have moved to the evacuation route behind the Lord's
      Manor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328446
    m_Localized: If you can hold the plaza entrance, we can stop the damage from
      spreading to the center.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328447
    m_Localized: Then let us finish this at the plaza entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328448
    m_Localized: I will protect the center of Jeple!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328449
    m_Localized: The tracks of the large group from the waterway side continue all
      the way to the plaza entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328450
    m_Localized: The traces of nearby monsters overlap in the same direction too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328451
    m_Localized: Since we cleared the waterway, the guards should be able to stop
      the monsters on that side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328452
    m_Localized: But if the large creature holds out for too long, the plaza entrance
      defensive line will start to shake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328453
    m_Localized: The plaza is wide, so it is better for finding injured people, but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233869328454
    m_Localized: Because it is wide, it also looks easy to get hurt while running
      around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522688
    m_Localized: Keep the evacuation route open and stop them at the plaza entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522689
    m_Localized: Even if the large creature appears, let us stop the group coming
      down first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522690
    m_Localized: Yeah. The large creature is still behind the front group.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522691
    m_Localized: The front group will arrive first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522692
    m_Localized: I will stop the front!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522693
    m_Localized: If the big one behind them comes too, we can stop it together!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522694
    m_Localized: Yeah. But if the front group scatters, the evacuation route will
      be in danger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522695
    m_Localized: If you are hurt, fall back inside the defensive line right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522696
    m_Localized: If you hold it in because it is the last battle, it will be harder
      after it ends...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522697
    m_Localized: They are coming in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522698
    m_Localized: The front group will reach the plaza entrance soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522699
    m_Localized: All right. Let us stop the front group first at the plaza entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522700
    m_Localized: We stopped the damage from spreading deeper into the plaza.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522701
    m_Localized: The center of Jeple is safe too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522702
    m_Localized: Good! Everyone, we protected Jeple too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522703
    m_Localized: Finally, some good news.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522704
    m_Localized: At this point, did we protect our break time too...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233873522705
    m_Localized: It is too early to conclude that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877716992
    m_Localized: The large monster was not trying to stop at the plaza either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877716993
    m_Localized: The tracks look closer to it trying to pass through the plaza.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877716994
    m_Localized: So Jeple was not the target, but a path it was passing through?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877716995
    m_Localized: Yeah. The traces we have seen so far look that way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877716996
    m_Localized: An additional report came in during the waterway repairs. They say
      both the blocked waterway and the monster tracks point toward Lumer Forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877716997
    m_Localized: Lumer Forest?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877716998
    m_Localized: If it is a forest, that means more walking...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877716999
    m_Localized: There will be tree shade, right...? Please let there be...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717000
    m_Localized: Let us rest later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717001
    m_Localized: Then the monsters entering Jeple may have been caused by movement
      being driven in from the forest side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717002
    m_Localized: It is possible. But we still do not know the cause. We need to check
      it ourselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717003
    m_Localized: The traces toward the forest are the strongest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717004
    m_Localized: The waterway and the footprints are pointing the same way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717005
    m_Localized: If they get driven in from the forest side again, Jeple will be
      in danger again too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717006
    m_Localized: Hand Jeple's defense over to the manager, and let's move to the
      entrance of Lumer Forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717007
    m_Localized: Yeah. We need to see how far the movement we saw in Jeple continues.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717008
    m_Localized: The traces we saw in Jeple continue all the way here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717009
    m_Localized: The direction is from inside the forest to the outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717010
    m_Localized: Then the monsters rushed from here toward Jeple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717011
    m_Localized: It's too early to say this is where it started.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717012
    m_Localized: But what is clear is that the monsters came flooding out from inside
      the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717013
    m_Localized: I can't believe traces like this continued right behind Jeple...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717014
    m_Localized: Even seeing it after we stopped them, it still doesn't feel good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717015
    m_Localized: I thought forests were quiet places...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717016
    m_Localized: So some places are even more uncomfortable because they're quiet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717017
    m_Localized: It's okay! If it's quiet, we can hurry and check it now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717018
    m_Localized: ...The lack of sound just made me more uneasy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717019
    m_Localized: Before we head inside, let's check the traces near the entrance
      first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717020
    m_Localized: The footprints are scattered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717021
    m_Localized: They weren't gathering to fight. These are traces of them losing
      direction and crowding toward the entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717022
    m_Localized: The footprints heading outside are deep, and the ones that turned
      back inside are shallow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717023
    m_Localized: It looks like they were forced out, then tried to hide back in the
      forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717024
    m_Localized: They weren't going back and forth over the same spot. These are
      traces of being pushed out and then holding their ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717025
    m_Localized: If they lost their way, we need to be even more careful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717026
    m_Localized: That means we don't know where they'll bolt next.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717027
    m_Localized: Yeah. Rather than chase them recklessly, we need to block the entrance
      side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717028
    m_Localized: If they scatter here, they could head down toward Jeple again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717029
    m_Localized: Then we need to hold them at the entrance first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717030
    m_Localized: I'll take the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717031
    m_Localized: I won't let them get out of the forest!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717032
    m_Localized: If someone gets hurt on a forest path, moving them will be hard
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717033
    m_Localized: Please, if anyone has to fall, let it only be on flat ground...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717034
    m_Localized: The movement has gotten closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717035
    m_Localized: They're crowding out toward the entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717036
    m_Localized: All right. Stop them at the entrance of Lumer Forest before they
      rush toward Jeple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717037
    m_Localized: We stopped them, but... it's strange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717038
    m_Localized: It felt more like they were trying to get out than attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717039
    m_Localized: They didn't look like they wanted to fight, but we couldn't let
      them head back down toward Jeple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717040
    m_Localized: Yeah. These aren't traces of them gathering toward us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717041
    m_Localized: These are traces of them avoiding the inside and crowding out toward
      the entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717042
    m_Localized: It's clearer than what we saw in Jeple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717043
    m_Localized: This wasn't simply movement along a path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717044
    m_Localized: Then that means there's something more horrific inside the forest,
      right...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717045
    m_Localized: Just hearing that makes me want to rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717046
    m_Localized: I understand wanting to rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717047
    m_Localized: Still, right now we need to see why they stopped at the entrance
      first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717048
    m_Localized: The footprints continue toward the footpath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717049
    m_Localized: Some of them seem to have turned back inside from the entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233877717050
    m_Localized: Then this isn't over here yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911296
    m_Localized: There's still something left inside the forest, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911297
    m_Localized: Let's organize the battle record from the forest entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911298
    m_Localized: After comparing them with the traces we saw in Jeple, let's prepare
      to head inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911299
    m_Localized: Yeah. We'll need to look more closely than we did at Jeple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911300
    m_Localized: The footprints don't continue in one straight line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911301
    m_Localized: They changed direction several times, but in the end they all crowded
      toward the same side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911302
    m_Localized: The deep footprints lead out of the forest, and the shallow ones
      lead inward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911303
    m_Localized: It looks like monsters that lost their way all crowded toward the
      same side at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911304
    m_Localized: Yeah. But for simple wandering, their direction is too similar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911305
    m_Localized: Rather than follow the whole footpath, we need to look for where
      they gather in the same direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911306
    m_Localized: Even people are in real danger if they get lost in a forest...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911307
    m_Localized: So it gets even more troublesome when monsters get lost too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911308
    m_Localized: Let's follow the footpath and confirm the direction before the traces
      split again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911309
    m_Localized: Leave markers toward Jeple too. We can't let the way back get blocked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911310
    m_Localized: Oh, the way back really is important...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911311
    m_Localized: The footprints toward the footpath are shallower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911312
    m_Localized: Rather than running, these are traces of trying to hold their ground
      and not be pushed away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911313
    m_Localized: There may be something inside the forest disrupting their movement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911314
    m_Localized: For now, let's leave it as a possibility.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233881911315
    m_Localized: The signal stone reaction is weak, but it also continues deeper
      into the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105600
    m_Localized: It's less a cause and more a trace we can follow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105601
    m_Localized: Good. Let's go in without losing the markers!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105602
    m_Localized: Going in is fine, but let's remember the way out too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105603
    m_Localized: It'd be a problem if we got added to the list of lost ones...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105604
    m_Localized: The permanent enhancement selection UI opens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105605
    m_Localized: 'Selection examples: Noah critical rate increase / Serah HP increase
      / Spayne healing amount increase.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105606
    m_Localized: The selected enhancement remains in later battles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105607
    m_Localized: From here, the traces have gotten more complicated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105608
    m_Localized: They followed the path, slipped into the bushes, then returned to
      the path again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105609
    m_Localized: It looks like they couldn't find the way while running away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105610
    m_Localized: But their final direction is almost the same.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105611
    m_Localized: Even if they look scattered, in the end they're being drawn toward
      the same side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105612
    m_Localized: If you're shoved around on a narrow path, it's easy to get hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105613
    m_Localized: Even scratches from bushes can linger longer than you'd think...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105614
    m_Localized: If it's narrow, blocking them is easier, but if we miss them, finding
      them again will be hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105615
    m_Localized: Right. That's why we can't leave the center open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105616
    m_Localized: Hold the center of the footpath, but don't chase too deep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105617
    m_Localized: Stop the scattered groups from slipping toward Jeple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105618
    m_Localized: There's movement in the bushes on the left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105619
    m_Localized: A small group is hiding below the path on the right too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105620
    m_Localized: Then I'll hold the middle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105621
    m_Localized: Tell me right away if they slip out to either side!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105622
    m_Localized: The bushes make it hard to watch both sides at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105623
    m_Localized: If we follow too forcefully, we might lose them instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105624
    m_Localized: The traces on the right are shallow. It's a small group.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105625
    m_Localized: On the left, branches just broke. A larger group is close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105626
    m_Localized: Then stop the large group on the left first, and handle the small
      group on the right inside the footpath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105627
    m_Localized: Good. I'll hold the bigger group!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105628
    m_Localized: If you're hurt, come back right away. I'll take a look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105629
    m_Localized: If anyone rolls out of the bushes, I'll sigh first and then treat
      them...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105630
    m_Localized: The movement has started.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105631
    m_Localized: They're coming out from both sides of the path at the same time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105632
    m_Localized: All right. Let's stop them at the center of the footpath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105633
    m_Localized: Don't give them any opening to slip toward Jeple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105634
    m_Localized: For now, we kept them from scattering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105635
    m_Localized: As expected, those things moved like they were scared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105636
    m_Localized: Rather than scared, it's more that we don't know where they'll bolt,
      which is even more exhausting...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105637
    m_Localized: Right. They didn't spread out to attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105638
    m_Localized: They searched for somewhere to escape, then crowded in the same
      direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105639
    m_Localized: If this were natural movement, they wouldn't gather again at the
      same point like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105640
    m_Localized: There's still something left to check deeper in the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105641
    m_Localized: The phrase "something left to check" is starting to sound scarier
      and scarier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105642
    m_Localized: Still, stopping now would feel even more unsettling...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105643
    m_Localized: There's a logging site up ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105644
    m_Localized: The footprints become heavily disturbed right in front of the logging
      site.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105645
    m_Localized: The movement up ahead has grown again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105646
    m_Localized: They're rushing toward the footpath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105647
    m_Localized: Fall back. The path is narrow, so we can't all get out at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105648
    m_Localized: I'll block the front. You all get out first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105649
    m_Localized: Serah, fall back with us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105650
    m_Localized: It's okay! You know I'm good at stopping things like this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105651
    m_Localized: I'll catch up right away!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105652
    m_Localized: Don't say that...! I said don't!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105653
    m_Localized: ...Serah's footsteps stopped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105654
    m_Localized: No... she was with us just a moment ago...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105655
    m_Localized: She said she'd catch up right away...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105656
    m_Localized: Why did she go off alone...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105657
    m_Localized: We could have fought with her...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105658
    m_Localized: Spayne, if we stop now, we'll lose the path Serah barely opened
      for us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105659
    m_Localized: We'll lose the reason Serah sent us ahead, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105660
    m_Localized: So we have to move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105661
    m_Localized: ...We have to move, but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105662
    m_Localized: Sorry. I can't speak properly right now either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105663
    m_Localized: There is still monster movement up ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105664
    m_Localized: ...This is the opening Serah made for us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105665
    m_Localized: Knowing Serah, she'd hate it even more if we stopped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105666
    m_Localized: Then what about Serah...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105667
    m_Localized: Let's trust Serah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105668
    m_Localized: Serah didn't stay behind to make us stop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105669
    m_Localized: She stayed to send us forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105670
    m_Localized: If we fall apart here, we'll lose the path Serah made, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105671
    m_Localized: Let's head toward the logging site. We need to stop the remaining
      monsters and open the path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105672
    m_Localized: And let's make sure we find Serah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105673
    m_Localized: ...All right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105674
    m_Localized: Yeah. We will.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105675
    m_Localized: Wait. There are Serah's footprints up ahead!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105676
    m_Localized: They didn't stop. They keep going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105677
    m_Localized: Really...? Noah, are you sure?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105678
    m_Localized: Yeah. There are marks from her sword scraping the ground too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105679
    m_Localized: Let's follow them before the footprints disappear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105680
    m_Localized: Serah...! If you can hear me, answer...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105681
    m_Localized: Wait. Something moved up ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105682
    m_Localized: I can hear a sword scraping the ground too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105683
    m_Localized: ...Yes. It's Serah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105684
    m_Localized: Serah!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105685
    m_Localized: Everyone, over here...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105686
    m_Localized: I'm okay! Is everyone safe?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105687
    m_Localized: That's what we're supposed to ask you...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105688
    m_Localized: Are you hurt anywhere? Are you really okay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105689
    m_Localized: Say you're okay after we check. Spayne, take a look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105690
    m_Localized: Yeah... This time, I'm not just taking your word for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105691
    m_Localized: All right. Check me. But I'm not badly hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105692
    m_Localized: I'm glad you're safe, Serah. What happened?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105693
    m_Localized: Why did you stay behind alone... We could have fought with you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105694
    m_Localized: Sorry. I thought that was the only way you could get out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233886105695
    m_Localized: When the path collapsed, I was pushed downward, but it wasn't completely
      cut off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299904
    m_Localized: It continued on a slope, like an old work path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299905
    m_Localized: So that's why the footprints didn't stop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299906
    m_Localized: Yeah. I climbed back up by bracing myself with my sword. I also
      ran into a few monsters on the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299907
    m_Localized: Don't say something like that so calmly...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299908
    m_Localized: Sorry. I tried to come back right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299909
    m_Localized: But at the end of the lower work path, I saw a strange light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299910
    m_Localized: You didn't touch that light, did you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299911
    m_Localized: No. I didn't touch it. If anything, the monsters came bursting out
      to avoid that light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299912
    m_Localized: I only stopped the ones that came toward me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299913
    m_Localized: Then the reaction we already knew about appeared on Serah's side
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299914
    m_Localized: There's a similar marking on the central stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299915
    m_Localized: Let's check whether the two traces connect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299916
    m_Localized: The footprints curve around the edge of the clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299917
    m_Localized: There are almost no traces of anything going near the center.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299918
    m_Localized: The traces show they hesitated in front of the marking, then turned
      aside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299919
    m_Localized: Like they didn't go around on purpose, but were pushed away in front
      of the marking?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299920
    m_Localized: Yeah. The traces show they tried to hold on, then got pushed sideways.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299921
    m_Localized: An unknown marking in the middle of the forest...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299922
    m_Localized: I wish it were just an old trail sign... but it probably isn't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299923
    m_Localized: If trail signs feel this ominous, I might consider getting lost
      instead...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299924
    m_Localized: Don't touch the area around the marking. Let's check the monster
      movement first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299925
    m_Localized: There's movement deeper in the logging site.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299926
    m_Localized: They're splitting to both sides to avoid the marking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299927
    m_Localized: The direction they're avoiding it is consistent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299928
    m_Localized: It's different from simply going around an obstacle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299929
    m_Localized: Then they're coming from both sides, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299930
    m_Localized: Let's stop them together before they scatter!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299931
    m_Localized: Be careful not to get caught on the tree stumps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299932
    m_Localized: There are too many things here that could hurt you if you fall...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299933
    m_Localized: They're coming from both sides.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299934
    m_Localized: They're avoiding the center.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299935
    m_Localized: Let's stop them at the edge of the logging site.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299936
    m_Localized: Don't drive them toward the marking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299937
    m_Localized: The monsters avoided the center to the very end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299938
    m_Localized: Rather than avoiding it by choice, it looked like they couldn't
      get close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299939
    m_Localized: Now that the battle is over, let's take a closer look at the marking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299940
    m_Localized: The logging traces and the marking are both old. I don't think anyone
      touched them recently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299941
    m_Localized: But the reaction below the marking cuts off, then continues again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299942
    m_Localized: If we want to find the cause, we need to check farther below.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299943
    m_Localized: Then what I saw really is a clue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299944
    m_Localized: Yeah. There is a good chance it is a clue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299945
    m_Localized: It is too early to say it is a device, but I do not think it is
      just a simple marking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299946
    m_Localized: The signal stone reaction also shook very faintly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299947
    m_Localized: We need to check the remaining reaction farther below.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299948
    m_Localized: I do not want to stay too long next to an unknown marking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299949
    m_Localized: Even if it is just my imagination, it feels like my body is getting
      heavier...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299950
    m_Localized: The footprints continue toward the wetland.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299951
    m_Localized: They became much more disturbed after avoiding the marking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299952
    m_Localized: Record the marking's location, and let us check the wetland where
      the footprints continue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299953
    m_Localized: Wetlands are the worst.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299954
    m_Localized: Your feet sink, your clothes get wet, and injured people become
      even heavier...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299955
    m_Localized: If someone falls in the mud, you cannot even tell whether to treat
      an injury or clean up the mess first...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299956
    m_Localized: Still, the trail continues this way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299957
    m_Localized: We cannot just turn back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299958
    m_Localized: The footprints keep cutting off at the water's edge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299959
    m_Localized: But even after they cut off, the direction still points toward the
      central clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299960
    m_Localized: The signal stone reaction is shaking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299961
    m_Localized: The reaction we saw at the logging site has become more irregular
      here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299962
    m_Localized: You mean there is a magical reaction?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299963
    m_Localized: Yeah. But there still is not enough evidence to say that it is the
      cause.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299964
    m_Localized: It is more accurate to see this as a point where the reaction from
      an old device is leaking out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299965
    m_Localized: There is a large track at the edge of the wetland.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299966
    m_Localized: The smaller monsters went around to avoid that trace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299967
    m_Localized: Did something big pass through first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299968
    m_Localized: That is how it looks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299969
    m_Localized: But there are no signs of pursuit here either. All the smaller monsters
      are avoiding it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299970
    m_Localized: So we are walking into the place they are avoiding...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299971
    m_Localized: That sounds like a pretty bad choice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299972
    m_Localized: You are right, but the more right you are, the harder this path
      gets...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299973
    m_Localized: You are right, but the more right you are, the harder this road
      gets...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299974
    m_Localized: Yeah. That is why we need to check further.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299975
    m_Localized: We need to see whether this reaction is disrupting the monsters'
      movement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299976
    m_Localized: The movement is getting closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299977
    m_Localized: They are coming around the water's edge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299978
    m_Localized: Before they slip toward the central clearing, let us stop them at
      the edge of the wetland.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299979
    m_Localized: There was not just one marking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299980
    m_Localized: The marking on the wetland side is connected to a device fragment
      buried under the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299981
    m_Localized: If it is a device, who made it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299982
    m_Localized: I do not know yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299983
    m_Localized: All I can confirm is that the device fragment is old and damaged,
      and its reaction is still leaking out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299984
    m_Localized: The monsters avoided this area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299985
    m_Localized: But while trying to avoid it, they were driven toward the central
      clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299986
    m_Localized: Then that is where we need to go too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299987
    m_Localized: Every time this kind of reasoning turns out to be right, it gets
      exhausting...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299988
    m_Localized: The large footprints also lead to the central clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299989
    m_Localized: They are the deepest ones we have seen so far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299990
    m_Localized: Let us secure a retreat route before entering the central clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299991
    m_Localized: If we enter the central clearing unprepared, we will not even have
      time to check the device reaction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299992
    m_Localized: Yeah. I will record the reaction's location too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299993
    m_Localized: If it is connected to the reaction in the central clearing, we should
      look for a way to stabilize it instead of breaking it blindly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299994
    m_Localized: We also need to compare it with the pattern on the logging site
      marking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299995
    m_Localized: All right. Let us prepare, then head in!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299996
    m_Localized: If there is even a little dry ground, let us regroup there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299997
    m_Localized: Resting on a wetland is not really resting...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299998
    m_Localized: At least a stretcher should be able to pass through here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890299999
    m_Localized: It is not a good road, but it is much better than having none.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300000
    m_Localized: So this is our retreat route?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300001
    m_Localized: Yeah. If we are pushed back from the central clearing, we retreat
      through this path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300002
    m_Localized: But if possible, we need to finish this inside the clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300003
    m_Localized: The large movement is inside the central clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300004
    m_Localized: The nearby monsters are avoiding the large movement and being driven
      outward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300005
    m_Localized: We still do not know whether the large monster is the cause, or
      whether it was swept up in the same reaction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300006
    m_Localized: But the reaction near the clearing is the most unstable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300007
    m_Localized: Then let us go in and see it for ourselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300008
    m_Localized: We just have to stop them before they get pushed farther outside!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300009
    m_Localized: Confidence is good, but do not go too far inside the clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300010
    m_Localized: The way back is part of the battle too...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300011
    m_Localized: Got it. Even if I push in, I will leave a way back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300012
    m_Localized: The footprints curve in a circle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300013
    m_Localized: These traces show they went around in a curve to avoid the side
      with the large movement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300014
    m_Localized: The logging site marking, the wetland device fragment, and the central
      clearing reaction may all be connected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300015
    m_Localized: I think we need to suppress the unstable part instead of cutting
      off the reaction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300016
    m_Localized: Then we should not break it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300017
    m_Localized: I wish this were the kind of device that would stop if we broke
      it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300018
    m_Localized: Let us decide after we check the clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300019
    m_Localized: Retreat route secured and signal stone tuning effects are applied.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300020
    m_Localized: The permanent enhancement selection UI opens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300021
    m_Localized: 'Selection examples: Alice attack increase / Serah defense increase
      / Noah critical damage increase.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300022
    m_Localized: The selected enhancement remains active in later battles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300023
    m_Localized: The movement has grown stronger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300024
    m_Localized: It is being driven outward from inside the clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300025
    m_Localized: Good. Let us enter the central clearing and stop the large group
      before it scatters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300026
    m_Localized: All the footprints lead here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300027
    m_Localized: And from here, they were driven outward again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300028
    m_Localized: So this is where the movement inside the forest gathers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300029
    m_Localized: The signal stone reaction is the most unstable here too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300030
    m_Localized: Rather than creating the reaction itself, the structure seems to
      be shaking because it is receiving a reaction from somewhere else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300031
    m_Localized: The footprints around the structure are pressed deep into the ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300032
    m_Localized: It looks like the monsters tried to hold out here, then were driven
      outward again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300033
    m_Localized: Fighting in a place with this many unknowns is always unpleasant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300034
    m_Localized: Especially when something is glowing under the ground...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300035
    m_Localized: Let us stop the group being driven outside the clearing before it
      slips toward Jeple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300036
    m_Localized: The large movement is behind the structure at the center of the
      clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300037
    m_Localized: The nearby monsters are moving to avoid it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300038
    m_Localized: Then we stop the front group first, and deal with the big one behind
      them, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300039
    m_Localized: Yeah. We need to hold the front group in place before it scatters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300040
    m_Localized: If the group scatters, it could spread back to the forest entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300041
    m_Localized: If you get hurt, fall back to the retreat route.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300042
    m_Localized: If you push yourself here, the way back will only get longer...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300043
    m_Localized: The movement has started.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300044
    m_Localized: The front group is reaching the edge of the clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300045
    m_Localized: All right. Let us stop them in the central clearing of Lumer Forest
      before the large group rushes out of the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300046
    m_Localized: We stopped the large group too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300047
    m_Localized: Now there should be less movement being driven from the forest toward
      Jeple, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300048
    m_Localized: The reaction inside the forest is shaking most strongly around this
      structure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300049
    m_Localized: I checked the magical range, and it matches what we have suspected
      so far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300050
    m_Localized: If we leave it like this, the movement inside the forest may become
      unstable again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300051
    m_Localized: Then let us stop it now. We cannot let them be driven toward Jeple
      again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300052
    m_Localized: I will try suppressing the reaction with the signal stones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300053
    m_Localized: This will not fix it completely. It is more like blocking the leaking
      part.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300054
    m_Localized: So it is not fixing it, just making it leak less...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300055
    m_Localized: Even that is a big enough job for today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300056
    m_Localized: The monster movement has decreased.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300057
    m_Localized: The footsteps that were being driven outward are moving farther
      away too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300058
    m_Localized: Good. For now, we stopped the movement that was being driven toward
      Jeple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300059
    m_Localized: The reaction in the central clearing has stabilized for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300060
    m_Localized: But the direction the reaction came from is still traceable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300061
    m_Localized: Where does it lead?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300062
    m_Localized: Judging by the reaction's direction, it points toward the Verdin
      Mining Area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300063
    m_Localized: It may be connected to ore veins around the mine, or to old facilities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300064
    m_Localized: After the forest, now it is a mine...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233890300065
    m_Localized: So after somewhere damp, we are going somewhere dark too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688512
    m_Localized: I cannot believe there was still somewhere harder to rest than the
      forest...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688513
    m_Localized: Still, we have a direction now. We know where to check next.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688514
    m_Localized: It looks like the large monster was trying to avoid this reaction
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688515
    m_Localized: These are not traces of it waiting to attack us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688516
    m_Localized: Then this is not over yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688517
    m_Localized: There are still traces continuing onward, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688518
    m_Localized: Yeah. If the reaction we confirmed in Lumer Forest continues toward
      the mine, we need to check it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688519
    m_Localized: For now, though, let us record that we reduced the movement being
      driven out of Lumer Forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688520
    m_Localized: Let us organize the Lumer Forest records and check the reaction
      leading toward the Verdin Mining Area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688521
    m_Localized: Make sure the records are thorough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688522
    m_Localized: It would feel unfair if we later forgot why we came all this way...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688523
    m_Localized: Are you the Guardians from the Lumer Forest side?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688524
    m_Localized: That's right. The reaction that shook the device in Lumer Forest
      continued toward the Verdin Mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688525
    m_Localized: The situation in Verdin is not good either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688526
    m_Localized: Monsters are pushing up from the lower part of the mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688527
    m_Localized: That matches the traces pointing toward Verdin that we found in
      the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688528
    m_Localized: The footprints did not come down from the mountain. They came out
      from the mine tunnel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688529
    m_Localized: In Lumer Forest, they were driven outward. Here, they are coming
      up from underground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688530
    m_Localized: The same abnormal reaction may be appearing differently depending
      on the terrain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688531
    m_Localized: If this is a mining village, the roads must be narrow and full of
      equipment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688532
    m_Localized: If anyone gets hurt, even moving them will become a problem...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688533
    m_Localized: Not all workers below have made it out yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688534
    m_Localized: We must keep the road toward the village square clear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688535
    m_Localized: Then we just need to stop the monsters from entering the square,
      right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688536
    m_Localized: I will hold the front while people get out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688537
    m_Localized: Do not go too deep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688538
    m_Localized: If more come from the mine tunnel, we need room to fall back toward
      the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688539
    m_Localized: I know. Standing at the front is different from charging in recklessly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688540
    m_Localized: The people behind me need to be able to trust me and move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688541
    m_Localized: Oh, you are pretty serious today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688542
    m_Localized: Back then, I picked up a sword to avoid cooking duty, but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688543
    m_Localized: That is the first I have heard of that reason...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688544
    m_Localized: Now there are people behind me that I have to protect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688545
    m_Localized: The movement is getting closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688546
    m_Localized: They are coming up from below the mine entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688547
    m_Localized: All right. Let us stop them at the mining village entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688548
    m_Localized: Protect the road to the square until the workers get out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688549
    m_Localized: We prevented damage to the village square, and most of the workers
      below have escaped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688550
    m_Localized: Good. The evacuated people are safe, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688551
    m_Localized: Yes. Thanks to you, the evacuation route was opened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688552
    m_Localized: There are no signs that the monsters surrounded the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688553
    m_Localized: They were pushed up from the mine tunnel and stopped at the village
      entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688554
    m_Localized: The reaction feels heavier than what we saw in the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688555
    m_Localized: It seems like the underground structure is holding on to the magical
      reaction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688556
    m_Localized: I hope what it is holding on to is not people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688557
    m_Localized: The farther down we go, the longer the way back gets...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688558
    m_Localized: A report also came in from the abandoned mine tunnel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688559
    m_Localized: They say there is a constant sound from inside, like ore ringing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688560
    m_Localized: Let us organize the village defense records first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688561
    m_Localized: We need to prepare support before entering the mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688562
    m_Localized: Yeah. I will compare it with the forest reaction records.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688563
    m_Localized: The village-side defense has stabilized.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688564
    m_Localized: But if we cannot block the mine entrance, they will come back up
      toward the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688565
    m_Localized: Move the injured who have trouble walking into the support station
      first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688566
    m_Localized: For minor wounds, wrap them with bandages first, and I will handle
      treatment in stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688567
    m_Localized: Is it okay not to treat them right away?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688568
    m_Localized: There is a difference between wounds that can wait and wounds that
      become dangerous if we miss them now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688569
    m_Localized: In the past, I once tried to treat every wound in front of me right
      away and ended up too late for something bigger...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688570
    m_Localized: So that is why you are setting the order now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688571
    m_Localized: Yeah. I am not delaying it because it is annoying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688572
    m_Localized: I am sorting things now so they do not become more troublesome later...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688573
    m_Localized: There are a lot of footprints near the mine entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688574
    m_Localized: They are all traces of being driven from the inside outward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688575
    m_Localized: The signal stone reaction also feels heavier than it did in Lumer
      Forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688576
    m_Localized: Ore or an old device may be holding the reaction in place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688577
    m_Localized: A metallic wailing sound keeps coming from inside the abandoned
      mine tunnel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688578
    m_Localized: I heard it seems to have started deeper inside the abandoned mine
      tunnel, near the old transport rail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688579
    m_Localized: Let us check the mine entrance first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688580
    m_Localized: We will enter the abandoned mine tunnel and the old rail area after
      that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688581
    m_Localized: Good. We need to block the entrance before we can go inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688582
    m_Localized: If the entrance collapses, the way back will be blocked too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688583
    m_Localized: I will mark the path before we go in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688584
    m_Localized: The permanent enhancement selection UI opens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688585
    m_Localized: 'Selection examples: Serah defense increase / Spayne HP increase
      / Alice attack increase.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688586
    m_Localized: The selected enhancement remains active in later battles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688587
    m_Localized: This is the main mine tunnel inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688588
    m_Localized: The monsters are coming up from the lower slope.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688589
    m_Localized: All the footprints are headed upward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688590
    m_Localized: They were not coming toward the village. They were pushed out from
      below.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688591
    m_Localized: Ugh...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688592
    m_Localized: There is movement on the inner right side too. It is not just one
      group.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688593
    m_Localized: Are you all right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688594
    m_Localized: Yeah. I have to say it right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688595
    m_Localized: I hesitated before and was too late... This time, I will say it
      right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688596
    m_Localized: Good. That report matters most right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688597
    m_Localized: We can deal with being startled later, when we rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688598
    m_Localized: Right now, keeping the way back from being blocked comes first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688599
    m_Localized: Let us take position in front of the entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688600
    m_Localized: Let us watch the movement on the inner right side too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688601
    m_Localized: I will block the entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688602
    m_Localized: Make sure we do not miss the right side Noah mentioned!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688603
    m_Localized: The left wall side is still quiet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688604
    m_Localized: We need to check the side where the sound stopped again too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688605
    m_Localized: The sound may not have stopped. It may be traveling along the wall
      and coming back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688606
    m_Localized: The right-side slope is narrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688607
    m_Localized: If they crowd to the right, I will clear them out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688608
    m_Localized: Quiet does not mean safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688609
    m_Localized: In a mine, not hearing something can be scarier...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688610
    m_Localized: The movement is getting faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688611
    m_Localized: They are being pushed up from below.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688612
    m_Localized: All right. Let us stop them at the mine entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688613
    m_Localized: Keep them from being driven toward the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688614
    m_Localized: We blocked the entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688615
    m_Localized: Still, the sound inside keeps going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688616
    m_Localized: The footprints came up from deeper inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688617
    m_Localized: There are almost no traces of them staying near the entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688618
    m_Localized: They were not aiming for the village or the entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688619
    m_Localized: It is closer to movement being pushed by the reaction underground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688620
    m_Localized: Then if we leave the lower area alone, they will keep coming up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688621
    m_Localized: Blocking only the entrance will not end this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688622
    m_Localized: That sound is louder toward the abandoned mine tunnel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688623
    m_Localized: It is a path that was blocked long ago, but it recently started
      ringing again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688624
    m_Localized: A blocked path ringing again does not sound like good news.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688625
    m_Localized: If they blocked it, there was probably a reason...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688626
    m_Localized: Let us move toward the abandoned mine tunnel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688627
    m_Localized: Let us confirm where the sound started.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688628
    m_Localized: I will leave path markers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688629
    m_Localized: We cannot lose the way back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688630
    m_Localized: This is an abandoned mine tunnel that was blocked long ago.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688631
    m_Localized: But a few days ago, a metallic wailing sound started coming from
      inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688632
    m_Localized: The footprints around the entrance look like they hesitated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688633
    m_Localized: There are also traces of them trying to enter, then being pushed
      back out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688634
    m_Localized: The pattern on the wall looks like the marking from Lumer Forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688635
    m_Localized: But this pattern looks less like a natural marking and more like
      a device marker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688636
    m_Localized: How can you tell it is a device marker?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688637
    m_Localized: I saw similar records at magic school.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688638
    m_Localized: Devices that gather or circulate magical reactions sometimes leave
      direction markers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688639
    m_Localized: They teach that at school too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688640
    m_Localized: They do. The more people fear a kind of magic, the less frightening
      it becomes when you know its rules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688641
    m_Localized: That is why I do not want to overlook markings like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688642
    m_Localized: Record the pattern's location.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688643
    m_Localized: For now, let us check the movement inside the abandoned mine tunnel
      first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688644
    m_Localized: The floor inside is deeply scratched.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688645
    m_Localized: It looks like the monsters scraped against the walls as they were
      pushed out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688646
    m_Localized: The scratches left on the wall all point in one direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688647
    m_Localized: If the device activated, it may have left traces in the direction
      it pushed the magical reaction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688648
    m_Localized: Only the area around the pattern has less dust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688649
    m_Localized: A narrow path is easy to hold from the front, but it will be dangerous
      if we get pushed back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688650
    m_Localized: While I hold out, check both walls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688651
    m_Localized: If we get pushed back in the abandoned mine tunnel, even retreating
      to the entrance will be a problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688652
    m_Localized: Bad paths usually make treatment worse too...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688653
    m_Localized: They are coming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688654
    m_Localized: They are coming up from the lower path inside the abandoned mine
      tunnel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688655
    m_Localized: Let us stop them at the abandoned mine tunnel entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688656
    m_Localized: Keep them from being driven toward the pattern.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688657
    m_Localized: The sound has weakened, but it has not disappeared completely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688658
    m_Localized: The footprints do not end here either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688659
    m_Localized: They continue toward the transport rail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688660
    m_Localized: The pattern's direction points toward the transport rail too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688661
    m_Localized: Rather than the abandoned mine tunnel being the starting point,
      it seems the reaction from the rail side spread all the way here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688662
    m_Localized: Then the place where the sound came from is farther inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688663
    m_Localized: Even if this is not the starting point, we are getting closer, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688664
    m_Localized: The transport rail was once used to move ore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688665
    m_Localized: Now only some sections remain, and the inner area is barely used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688666
    m_Localized: When an unused path causes trouble, it gets even more annoying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688667
    m_Localized: The maintenance records are probably old too...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688668
    m_Localized: But if there are records, they will be clues.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688669
    m_Localized: If it is an old device, traces may remain in the transport records
      or maintenance records.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688670
    m_Localized: Let us move to the transport rail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688671
    m_Localized: Let us check whether the device traces and the monsters' movement
      point in the same direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688672
    m_Localized: This rail was once used to carry ore out from the deepest area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688673
    m_Localized: Now only some sections have been left for inspections.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688674
    m_Localized: The footprints continue alongside the rail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688675
    m_Localized: It looks like the monsters avoided the rail itself, but were driven
      in the same direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688676
    m_Localized: The ore reaction is not consistent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688677
    m_Localized: The reaction cuts off below the rail, then continues again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688678
    m_Localized: If the rail is cut off, our path is cut off too, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688679
    m_Localized: We need to be more careful when the way in and the way out are the
      same.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688680
    m_Localized: Then we will have to protect the rail as we go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688681
    m_Localized: If we can at least move the cart, we can secure a path too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688682
    m_Localized: Wait. There is a maintenance record board beside the cart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688683
    m_Localized: It is old and partly worn away, but I can read some of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688684
    m_Localized: What does it say?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688685
    m_Localized: '`Location of broken magical device: beneath the Norua Highlands
      ruins corridor.`'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688686
    m_Localized: And the phrases `retrieval on hold` and `maintain mine connection`
      are still there too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688687
    m_Localized: Norua Highlands? That is somewhere else, isn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688688
    m_Localized: Yeah. It is not information we can act on right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688689
    m_Localized: But it may be evidence that this mine was connected to another device.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688690
    m_Localized: If retrieval was on hold, that means someone knew the location but
      could not touch it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688691
    m_Localized: Things like that usually become much more troublesome later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688692
    m_Localized: There is the same marking under the record board too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688693
    m_Localized: A line remains, leading deeper along the rail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688694
    m_Localized: The movement is getting closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688695
    m_Localized: They are coming up from the side where the rail is shaking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688696
    m_Localized: Preserve the record board, and protect the rail first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688697
    m_Localized: Let us keep the path to the deepest area from being cut off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688698
    m_Localized: We protected the rail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688699
    m_Localized: But that record is hard to ignore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688700
    m_Localized: Right. It is not a record for ordinary equipment used in the mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688701
    m_Localized: If it says beneath the Norua Highlands ruins corridor, it may be
      pointing to a much older facility.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233898688702
    m_Localized: The movement right now is coming from the deepest area, not Norua.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077120
    m_Localized: The large movement continues deeper inside here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077121
    m_Localized: Norua is not where we need to go right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077122
    m_Localized: But let us make sure we record that location.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077123
    m_Localized: The footprints bend away from the rail reaction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077124
    m_Localized: It looks like they were driven farther inside from there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077125
    m_Localized: If we enter the deepest area while the rail is unstable, we will
      have problems on the way back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077126
    m_Localized: Fixing it first will be less troublesome. Really.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077127
    m_Localized: To reach the deepest area, we need to repair at least part of the
      cart path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077128
    m_Localized: If the rail is blocked, it will be difficult to get out from inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077129
    m_Localized: Let us repair the rail and the return path before entering the deepest
      area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077130
    m_Localized: Ellis, keep the record board safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077131
    m_Localized: Yeah. I will mark the Norua location record separately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077132
    m_Localized: It will be difficult to fully restore the rail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077133
    m_Localized: But we can secure enough of it to enter the deepest area and come
      back out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077134
    m_Localized: That should be enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077135
    m_Localized: What we need right now is not a perfect rail, but a return path
      that will not collapse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077136
    m_Localized: So we are taking care of the way back first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077137
    m_Localized: I guess we cannot only think about moving forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077138
    m_Localized: The footprints toward the deepest area are the deepest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077139
    m_Localized: It looks like the nearby monsters were driven outward while avoiding
      the reaction from the deepest area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077140
    m_Localized: The ore reaction is strongest in the deepest area too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077141
    m_Localized: But it is hard to say it is the center. The whole mine looks like
      a connection point.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077142
    m_Localized: What about the Norua location record?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077143
    m_Localized: I kept it safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077144
    m_Localized: Right now, we need to check the reaction in the deepest area first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077145
    m_Localized: Records will not run away, but monsters may run or be driven out...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077146
    m_Localized: Let us handle the more troublesome side first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077147
    m_Localized: That is strangely convincing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077148
    m_Localized: The large movement is not approaching.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077149
    m_Localized: It is circling the same spot inside the deepest area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077150
    m_Localized: It may be movement from something looking for a place to escape.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077151
    m_Localized: Once we go in, we need to stop them before they scatter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077152
    m_Localized: The effects of repairing the rail and securing the return path are
      applied.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077153
    m_Localized: The permanent enhancement selection UI opens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077154
    m_Localized: 'Selection examples: increase Sera''s defense / increase Spine''s
      HP / increase Ellis''s attack.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077155
    m_Localized: The selected enhancement remains active in later battles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077156
    m_Localized: Good. Let us enter the deepest area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077157
    m_Localized: Let us confirm the large movement and stop it from being driven
      out toward the mining village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077158
    m_Localized: The large footprints circle around here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077159
    m_Localized: There are also traces of it trying to go outside, then being pushed
      back in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077160
    m_Localized: The ore reaction is too complicated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077161
    m_Localized: Rather than a center, it feels like a connection point where multiple
      reactions pass through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077162
    m_Localized: Then blocking this place alone will not end it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077163
    m_Localized: Yeah. But if we fail to stop it here, it will be driven back out
      toward the mining village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077164
    m_Localized: The deepest area is the last place I want to treat anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077165
    m_Localized: It is dark, narrow, and there is only one way back...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077166
    m_Localized: Keep the escape route by the rail open, and finish this inside the
      deepest area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077167
    m_Localized: Let us stop the large movement before it gets outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077168
    m_Localized: The nearby monsters are avoiding the traces of the large monster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077169
    m_Localized: If they are driven toward the ore layer, it will shake even more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077170
    m_Localized: Then I will hold the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077171
    m_Localized: I will leave the retreat route to you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077172
    m_Localized: I will tell you right away if the ore reaction grows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077173
    m_Localized: If the reaction spikes somewhere, I can try suppressing it with
      magic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077174
    m_Localized: If you get hurt, fall back toward the rail immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077175
    m_Localized: There is a reason we kept the way back open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077176
    m_Localized: The movement has started.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077177
    m_Localized: The group in front is moving first, and the large monster is behind
      them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077178
    m_Localized: Good. Let us stop them in the deepest area of Verdin Mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077179
    m_Localized: Do not let them slip out toward the mining village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077180
    m_Localized: We stopped the large group.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077181
    m_Localized: They will not be driven back toward the mining village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077182
    m_Localized: For now, yes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077183
    m_Localized: But the magical reaction does not end here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077184
    m_Localized: The mine was not the center.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077185
    m_Localized: The remains of the old device did amplify the reaction, but the
      magical reaction is escaping in another direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077186
    m_Localized: Where does it lead?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077187
    m_Localized: The traces by the drainage channel are the clearest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077188
    m_Localized: Yeah. The reaction toward the waterway remains.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077189
    m_Localized: The reaction that passed beneath the mine is flowing toward the
      Milen Lake region.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077190
    m_Localized: Milen is an area reached by the mine's waterways.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077191
    m_Localized: Parts of the old drainage channel lead toward Milen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077192
    m_Localized: After the mine, now a lake...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077193
    m_Localized: After somewhere dark comes somewhere wet. This order is way too
      diligent...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077194
    m_Localized: The Norua location record is still here too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077195
    m_Localized: But the traces right now are clearer toward Milen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077196
    m_Localized: Right. Let us keep the `beneath the Norua Highlands ruins corridor`
      record separately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077197
    m_Localized: It is a clue we will definitely need to revisit later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077198
    m_Localized: So now we check the Milen side first, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077199
    m_Localized: Yeah. Let us wrap up the situation in Verdin and move to the Milen
      Lake region.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7178233907077200
    m_Localized: Let us follow the reaction that escaped from the mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
